      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Does it sync correctly between multiple people if all of them are on the Open Beta?\n\nFor context, it may indeed be related to Network ID changes, as previously they would not be applied at all, while on the Beta they are. This means that it _could_ lead to incompatibilities between versions, as the live version will always fall back to the default network targeting, while the Beta will correctly apply custom IDs again. If it works between people on the beta, then it will fix itself once it goes live, we won't be able to adjust anything for the beta itself in that case.\n\nSDK2 worlds should be entirely unaffected by these changes.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
